          "actionStringVerbatim": "fire_blast,use_off_gcd=1,use_while_casting=1,if=cooldown_react&!buff.hot_streak.react&(action.fireball.executing&action.fireball.execute_remains>0.1|buff.pyroclasm.react&action.pyroblast.executing&action.pyroblast.execute_remains>0.1|action.flamestrike.executing&action.flamestrike.execute_remains>0.1)&(!scorch_execute.active|!talent.scorch)&buff.heating_up.react&(hot_streak_spells_in_flight+buff.heating_up.react=1)&gcd.remains<gcd.max",
